# Maya AUV (CSIR-NIO) digital-twin ArduSub defaults.
#
# Represents the CSIR National Institute of Oceanography "Maya" small survey
# AUV (Goa; developed with Univ. of Porto). Published specs encoded in
# README.md: ~1.7 m length, 0.234 m dia, ~55 kg, 200 m depth rating, ~1.5 m/s
# nominal, ~7.2 h endurance, single aft thruster + 2 stern planes + 2 rudders.
#
# FIDELITY NOTE: the real Maya ran a custom controller (MOOS-IvP / DSPIC),
# NOT ArduSub. This twin stands it up on ArduSub because the range tests the
# MAVLink/autopilot attack surface; the HULL is represented by the REMUS-100
# Gazebo body (sim_config/models/remus100 -- the nearest small-torpedo-AUV
# model available), which is close in class (torpedo AUV, ~1.6-1.7 m). The
# hydrodynamic coefficients of the real Maya are documented, not reproduced in
# the SDF (Tier-A body). The autopilot-logic / command-authentication findings
# this twin produces are firmware-accurate regardless of hull fidelity.
#
# This is the stock as-fielded posture (ArduSub defaults for the command link),
# so the test reveals whether the out-of-the-box configuration is exploitable.
# The thruster mapping and EK3 external-nav source below are load-bearing for
# the acoustic/ExternalNav vector; inherited from the REMUS-100 twin tune.

SERVO1_FUNCTION 33
SERVO2_FUNCTION 34
SERVO3_FUNCTION 35
SERVO4_FUNCTION 36
SERVO5_FUNCTION 37
SERVO6_FUNCTION 38

BATT_MONITOR     4
FS_OPTIONS       0

# EK3 (ArduSub's modern default estimator).
EK2_ENABLE 0
EK3_ENABLE 1
AHRS_EKF_TYPE 3

# Underwater position source: no GPS underwater; horizontal position comes from
# an acoustic positioning system (USBL/LBL/DVL), fed to ArduPilot as
# VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE by attacks/acoustic_spoof.py (which derives its
# Gazebo odometry topic from constants.MODEL_NAME).
GPS_TYPE 1
SIM_GPS_DISABLE 0
SIM_GPS_LOCK 1
VISO_TYPE 1
EK3_SRC1_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC1_VELXY 6
EK3_SRC1_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC1_VELZ 6
EK3_SRC1_YAW 6
COMPASS_USE 0
COMPASS_USE2 0
COMPASS_USE3 0
SIM_BARO_RND 0.01

# Depth-hold (ALT_HOLD) position-controller gains (inherited starting point;
# not re-tuned for Maya's exact mass/thrust ratio -- live-verify depth control).
PSC_ACCZ_P   2
PSC_ACCZ_I   4
PSC_ACCZ_FF  0.75
PSC_VELZ_P   8
PSC_POSZ_P   3
PSC_POSXY_P 2.5
PSC_VELXY_D 0.8
PSC_VELXY_I 0.5
PSC_VELXY_P 5.0

# AUTO-mode navigation (slack radius + conservative speed for stable SITL nav).
WPNAV_RADIUS  500
WPNAV_SPEED   100
